## 3.4 추상 타입 (Abstract Types)

### 3.4.1 추상 타입 정의

```julia
# 도형을 나타내는 추상 타입
abstract type Shape end

# 구체적 타입들
struct Circle <: Shape
    radius::Float64
end

struct Rectangle <: Shape
    width::Float64
    height::Float64
end

# Shape를 받는 함수
area(s::Shape) = error("구현되지 않음")

# 각 도형별 구현
area(c::Circle) = π * c.radius ^ 2
area(r::Rectangle) = r.width * r.height

# 사용
c = Circle(5.0)
r = Rectangle(4.0, 6.0)

area(c)     # 78.53981...
area(r)     # 24.0
```

### 3.4.2 추상 타입 계층구조

```julia
abstract type Animal end
abstract type Mammal <: Animal end
abstract type Bird <: Animal end

struct Dog <: Mammal
    name::String
end

struct Eagle <: Bird
    name::String
end

sound(a::Animal) = "???"
sound(d::Dog) = "멍멍"
sound(e::Eagle) = "애애앙"

sound(Dog("Buddy"))       # "멍멍"
sound(Eagle("Sky"))       # "애애앙"
```

